# NOTE: .devstub/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the stub `Sofuu` module
# (header + modulemap) that lets `make ios-typecheck` check every Swift file
# in ~3s without waiting on a multi-minute Rust cross-build. It is checked
# in, small, and never linked into the app.

